#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""bouch-review — promotion-review surface generator.

Sweeps a home directory for git repositories, collects *derived* evidence per
repo (git state, tests, tags, README excerpt, file tree, media artifacts, prior
inventory classification), renders a single-file HTML review artifact, and
exports a decisions.json the apply step consumes.

Usage:
    bouch-review generate [--root ~] [--out ~/bouch-review-out]
    bouch-review apply <decisions.json>   # report only for now

Evidence is derived, never trusted from a repo's own claims. Media is embedded
as ffmpeg-generated thumbnails; the HTML references full artifacts by
home-relative path so a `python3 -m http.server --directory <root>` serves them.
"""

